{
  "$comment": "Camera Motion templates calibrated against the FAS 1 reference analysis (Reel-E Bivackgränden + reference B). All rates are per second; total amplitude = rate x duration. zoom_rate: fraction/s (0.03 = 3%/s scale change, positive = push in). pan_rate: fraction of image width/s. rot_rate: degrees/s. parallax_target: median residual parallax as fraction of image width/s the renderer should produce for a mid-depth-range scene.",
